  "notes": "くるくる is an onomatopoeic word ({擬態{語|ご}|ぎたいご}) describing spinning or circular motion.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- くるくる{回|まわ}る: to spin round and round\n- くるくるの{髪|かみ}: curly hair\n- くるくる{巻|ま}く: to roll up tightly\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ぐるぐる: spinning (often implying dizziness or being wrapped around)\n- くるりと: with a spin (single rotation)",
